SQLarius: Good. That’s the expected behavior for a standard category search. Now we can take this a step further.
SQLarius: Since this searchbox is vulnerable, we can use more than just basic words.

SQLarius: With a UNION command, you can attach additional results to the original query. This includes categories the system normally hides.

SQLarius: When you’re ready, try using UNION to reveal a hidden category. Which is the admin_items.
SQLarius: And do not forget to make a quote in the beginning to get out of the quote and -- to make the rest into a comment.
SQLarius: If you need any help, press the hint button.
[end_timeline]